{"title":"Holy ESL at ESL Cafe ","startsAt":"2026-10-26T19:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-26T20:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"This group is an advanced and intermediate English learners who are interested to learn English language as a second language (ESL) using the Bible.\n\nHoly ESL is free and you DO NOT NEED to be a Christian. All and any faith is welcome, so come ready to engage in thought provoking conversations and deepening your understanding of both language and faith.\n\n**NOTE: Holy ESL will have separate tables within ESL Cafe. Please ask the team for directions.**","venue":{"name":"St Paul's Boor","address":"St. Paul's Boor, 227 Bloor St E, Toronto, ON. M4W 1C8, Toronto","lat":43.67121,"lng":-79.38131,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Holy ESL! Learn English and the Bible!","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/7/0/1/f/highres_532888703.jpeg"}